    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>About - GetHostel</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/style.css">

</head>

<body>

<!-- =====================================================
     HEADER
===================================================== -->

<header>

    <div class="logo">

        <img src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/images/logo.png"
             alt="GetHostel Logo">

        <h1>GetHostel</h1>

    </div>


    <nav>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/">
            Home
        </a>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/boys">
            Boys Hostels
        </a>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/girls">
            Girls Hostels
        </a>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/colive">
            Co-Live
        </a>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/about">
            About
        </a>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/contact">
            Contact
        </a>

        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/owner/login">
            Owner Login
        </a>

    </nav>

</header>


<!-- =====================================================
     ABOUT HERO
===================================================== -->

<section class="hero-section">

    <h2>About GetHostel</h2>

    <p>
        Find the right hostel, in the right location,
        at the right price.
    </p>

</section>


<!-- =====================================================
     ABOUT CONTENT
===================================================== -->

<section class="about">

    <h2>Welcome to GetHostel</h2>

    <p>
        GetHostel is a hostel discovery platform designed
        to make finding suitable accommodation easier,
        faster and more convenient.
    </p>

    <p>
        Users can explore different hostels based on
        their requirements and location. GetHostel provides
        separate options for Boys Hostels, Girls Hostels
        and Co-Live accommodations.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our goal is to provide useful hostel information
        in one place so that users can compare available
        options and choose a hostel that best matches
        their needs.
    </p>

</section>


<!-- =====================================================
     FEATURES
===================================================== -->

<section class="about">

    <h2>What You Can Do With GetHostel</h2>

    <div class="about-features">

        <div class="about-feature-card">

            <h3>🏠 Find Hostels</h3>

            <p>
                Explore hostels available in different
                locations and choose the accommodation
                that suits you.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-feature-card">

            <h3>📍 Location Based Search</h3>

            <p>
                GetHostel can use your location to help
                display hostels according to their
                distance from you.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-feature-card">

            <h3>👨 Boys Hostels</h3>

            <p>
                Browse accommodation options specifically
                available for boys.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-feature-card">

            <h3>👩 Girls Hostels</h3>

            <p>
                Browse accommodation options specifically
                available for girls.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-feature-card">

            <h3>🤝 Co-Live</h3>

            <p>
                Explore co-living accommodation options
                available on the platform.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-feature-card">

            <h3>🏢 Hostel Owners</h3>

            <p>
                Hostel owners can register and add their
                hostel information to reach potential users.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =====================================================
     WHY GETHOSTEL
===================================================== -->

<section class="about">

    <h2>Why GetHostel?</h2>

    <p>
        Finding a hostel can sometimes require checking
        multiple sources. GetHostel brings important
        hostel information together in a simple platform.
    </p>

    <p>
        Users can view hostel details such as location,
        available beds, pricing, facilities and contact
        information before deciding where to stay.
    </p>

    <p>
        We aim to make hostel discovery simple and
        convenient for students, working professionals
        and anyone looking for suitable accommodation.
    </p>

</section>


<!-- =====================================================
     OWNER SECTION
===================================================== -->

<section class="about">

    <h2>For Hostel Owners</h2>

    <p>
        Hostel owners can register on GetHostel and
        provide details about their accommodation.
    </p>

    <p>
        Owners can provide information such as hostel
        name, hostel type, location, pricing, available
        beds, facilities, contact information and
        Google Maps location.
    </p>

    <p>
        This helps users discover available hostels and
        get useful information before contacting the owner.
    </p>

</section>


<!-- =====================================================
     CONTACT CTA
===================================================== -->

<section class="about about-contact">

    <h2>Need Help?</h2>

    <p>
        If you have any questions or need assistance,
        feel free to contact us.
    </p>

    <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/contact"
       class="about-contact-button">

        Contact Us

    </a>

</section>


<!-- =====================================================
     FOOTER
===================================================== -->

<footer>

    © 2026 AU Private Limited. All Rights Reserved.

</footer>


</body>

</html>